Package: sollunamail
Version: 1.0.0
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 468612
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libstdc++6 (>= 12), libgcc-s1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6
Maintainer: Solluna IoT <support@solluna-iot.com>
Homepage: https://solluna-iot.com
Description: SollunaMail Cross-Platform Email, Calendar and Contacts Client (Self-Contained)
 SollunaMail is a modern Qt 6 desktop email client supporting Google OAuth 2.0,
 Apple iCloud (IMAP & CalDAV), Microsoft Outlook, Naver, Daum/Kakao, and
 custom IMAP/POP3/SMTP servers with integrated Calendar, Contacts, Privacy Hub,
 and Gemini / Codex AI assistance.
 Includes bundled Qt 6 runtime libraries, TLS/Platform plugins, and Chromium WebEngine.
